  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_018 (multimodal multiprofile avgpool) achieves 0.6186 accuracy, but its success could stem from multiprofile data, aggregation, or both. Testing RNA-only multiprofile with avgpool (config_002) isolates the effect of multiprofile data while using the same aggregation method. This clarifies whether multiprofile data itself contributes to performance improvements, which is critical for understanding the value of multimodal integration versus single-modality scaling. This experiment directly addresses uncertainty about the relative importance of profile setting vs. aggregation."
}

